@startuml
title ATM Withdrawal States

[*] --> SelectAmount

state "Select Amount" as SelectAmount
state "Verify Transaction" as VerifyTransaction
state "Invalid Amount" as InvalidAmount
state "Successful Withdrawal" as SuccessfulWithdrawal

SelectAmount : entry / Display amount options
SelectAmount : do / User selects an option or enters custom value
SelectAmount : exit / Proceed to verify transaction

VerifyTransaction : entry / Validate user input
VerifyTransaction : do / Check if transaction is valid
VerifyTransaction : exit / Transaction accepted or rejected

InvalidAmount : entry / Transaction rejected
InvalidAmount : do / Display error message and allow re-entry
InvalidAmount : exit / Re-enter amount or cancel

SuccessfulWithdrawal : entry / Transaction successful
SuccessfulWithdrawal : do / Dispense cash and update account balance
SuccessfulWithdrawal : exit / End transaction

SelectAmount --> VerifyTransaction : [Valid selection]
VerifyTransaction --> InvalidAmount : [Invalid transaction]
VerifyTransaction --> SuccessfulWithdrawal : [Valid transaction]

InvalidAmount --> SelectAmount : [Re-enter amount]
InvalidAmount --> [*] : [Cancel]

SuccessfulWithdrawal --> [*]

@enduml
